.TH TRIBUNAL 1 "2026-08-08" "Tribunal 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tribunal \- sealed adversarial decision review in Kujo
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tribunal
.I command options
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B tribunal review <file> \-\-panel <panel\-name> [\-\-mock|\-\-live] [\-\-private\-key <pem> \-\-public\-key <pem>]
.TP
.B tribunal resume <stopped\-run\-id> [\-\-private\-key <pem> \-\-public\-key <pem>]
.TP
.B tribunal compare <base\-run\-id> <candidate\-run\-id> \-\-output <prefix>
.TP
.B tribunal re\-review <base\-run\-id> <file> \-\-panel <panel\-name> \-\-output <prefix> [\-\-mock|\-\-live]
.TP
.B tribunal kill <file> [\-\-mock|\-\-live] [\-\-private\-key <pem> \-\-public\-key <pem>]
.TP
.B tribunal validate <file> [\-\-json]
.TP
.B tribunal list [\-\-status <status> \-\-panel <panel> \-\-limit <n> \-\-cursor <run\-id> \-\-json]
.TP
.B tribunal show <run\-id> [\-\-json]
.TP
.B tribunal replay <run\-id> [\-\-public\-key <pem> \-\-require\-signature]
.TP
.B tribunal keys \-\-private\-key <pem> \-\-public\-key <pem> [\-\-bits 2048|4096]
.TP
.B tribunal seal <run\-id> \-\-private\-key <pem> \-\-public\-key <pem>
.TP
.B tribunal verify <run\-id> [\-\-public\-key <pem> \-\-require\-signature]
.TP
.B tribunal verify\-bulk [\-\-cursor <run\-id> \-\-limit <1\-100> \-\-public\-key <pem> \-\-require\-signature]
.TP
.B tribunal ingest <run\-id> \-\-target runledger|casefile \-\-public\-key <pem>
.TP
.B tribunal export <run\-id> \-\-format json|jsonl
.TP
.B tribunal panels [\-\-json]
.TP
.B tribunal seats [\-\-json]
.TP
.B tribunal doctor [\-\-json]
.TP
.B tribunal stats [\-\-json]
.TP
.B tribunal contracts <run\-id> [\-\-json]
.TP
.B tribunal audit <run\-id> [\-\-public\-key <pem>|\-\-trust\-policy <json> \-\-target <name>] [\-\-require\-signature \-\-json]
.TP
.B tribunal seal\-provider <run\-id> \-\-provider\-config <json>
.TP
.B tribunal verify\-policy <run\-id> \-\-trust\-policy <json> \-\-target <name>
.TP
.B tribunal bundle\-export <run\-id> \-\-output <directory>
.TP
.B tribunal bundle\-import <directory> \-\-trust\-policy <json> \-\-target <name>
.TP
.B tribunal bundle\-encrypt <run\-id> \-\-output <directory> \-\-recipient\-public\-key <pem> [\-\-recovery\-public\-key <pem>]
.TP
.B tribunal bundle\-decrypt <directory> \-\-recipient\-private\-key <pem> \-\-trust\-policy <json> \-\-target <name>
.TP
.B tribunal bundle\-rekey <directory> \-\-recipient\-private\-key <pem> \-\-recipient\-public\-key <pem>
.TP
.B tribunal store\-publish <run\-id> [\-\-expected\-version <sha256>]
.TP
.B tribunal store\-pull <run\-id> [\-\-version <sha256>] \-\-trust\-policy <json>
.TP
.B tribunal telemetry\-export [\-\-collector jsonl|http \-\-destination <path|url> \-\-json]
.TP
.B tribunal locks\-recover [\-\-stale\-after\-ms <n> \-\-json]
.TP
.B tribunal index\-check [\-\-json]
.TP
.B tribunal index\-rebuild [\-\-json]
.TP
.B tribunal index\-repair [\-\-json]
.TP
.B tribunal delete <run\-id> \-\-reason <text> [\-\-force\-expired]
.TP
.B tribunal auth\-check \-\-permission <permission> [\-\-json]
.TP
.B tribunal dashboard\-export \-\-output <html> [\-\-json]
.TP
.B tribunal legal\-hold <run\-id> \-\-enable|\-\-release \-\-reason <text>
.TP
.B tribunal provenance\-sign <document> \-\-kind <kind> \-\-sequence <n> \-\-private\-key <pem> \-\-public\-key <pem> \-\-output <json> \-\-anchor <json> [\-\-previous <json>]
.TP
.B tribunal provenance\-verify <document> \-\-provenance <json> \-\-public\-key <pem> \-\-anchor <json>
.TP
.B tribunal version
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success; 1 runtime failure; 2 usage/configuration or stopped hearing; 3 integrity/authorization failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
Tribunal README and docs/OPERATIONS.md.
